        {
          "slug": "present-simple-affirmative",
          "titleUz": "Present Simple: darak gaplar",
          "titleEn": "Present Simple: affirmative",
          "skill": "GRAMMAR",
          "level": "A2",
          "order": 1,
          "estimatedMinutes": 25,
          "objectivesUz": [
            "Present Simple qachon ishlatilishini bilish",
            "3-shaxs birlikda -s/-es qo'shishni o'rganish",
            "Odatiy ish-harakatlar haqida gapirish"
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "theory",
              "titleUz": "Present Simple nima?",
              "bodyUz": "Present Simple — **odatiy, takrorlanadigan** ish-harakatlar va **umumiy haqiqatlar** uchun ishlatiladi:\n\n- Odatlar: *I drink tea every morning.* (Har kuni choy ichaman)\n- Jadval: *The lesson starts at 9.* (Dars 9 da boshlanadi)\n- Haqiqatlar: *Water boils at 100°C.*\n\nSignal so'zlar: **every day, always, usually, often, sometimes, never**"
            },
            {
              "type": "theory",
              "titleUz": "Oltin qoida: he/she/it + -s",
              "bodyUz": "3-shaxs birlikda (he, she, it) fe'lga **-s** qo'shiladi:\n\n- I work → He work**s**\n- We play → She play**s**\n\nMaxsus holatlar:\n- -o, -sh, -ch, -ss, -x bilan tugasa → **-es**: go → go**es**, watch → watch**es**\n- undosh + y bilan tugasa → **-ies**: study → stud**ies**\n- have → **has** (istisno!)"
            },
            {
              "type": "example",
              "titleUz": "Misollar",
              "items": [
                { "en": "I wake up at 6 o'clock.", "uz": "Men soat 6 da uyg'onaman." },
                { "en": "Aziza works at a bank.", "uz": "Aziza bankda ishlaydi." },
                { "en": "My father watches the news every evening.", "uz": "Otam har kuni kechqurun yangiliklarni ko'radi." },
                { "en": "She studies English online.", "uz": "U ingliz tilini onlayn o'rganadi." }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "bodyUz": "Multilevel imtihonining Listening va Reading qismlarida Present Simple eng ko'p uchraydigan zamon. «-s» ni unutish — writingda ham eng keng tarqalgan xato. «He/She/It — s bilan do'st» deb yodlab oling!"
            }
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "type": "MCQ_SINGLE",
              "skill": "GRAMMAR",
              "promptUz": "To'g'ri variantni tanlang:",
              "data": { "text": "My mother ___ delicious plov every Sunday.", "options": ["cook", "cooks", "cooking", "is cook"] },
              "answer": { "value": "cooks" },
              "explanationUz": "«My mother» = she → fe'lga -s qo'shiladi: cooks."
            },
            {
              "type": "GAP_FILL",
              "skill": "GRAMMAR",
              "promptUz": "Qavs ichidagi fe'lni to'g'ri shaklda yozing:",
