            "Do/Does bilan so'roq gap tuzish",
            "Qisqa javoblarni to'g'ri berish"
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "theory",
              "titleUz": "Inkor: don't / doesn't",
              "bodyUz": "Present Simple'da inkor uchun yordamchi fe'l kerak:\n\n- I/You/We/They + **don't** + fe'l: *I don't like coffee.*\n- He/She/It + **doesn't** + fe'l: *She doesn't work here.*\n\n⚠️ MUHIM: doesn't dan keyin fe'l **asos shaklda** qoladi (-s YO'Q!):\n❌ *She doesn't works* → ✅ *She doesn't work*"
            },
            {
              "type": "theory",
              "titleUz": "So'roq: Do / Does",
              "bodyUz": "- **Do** I/you/we/they + fe'l? — *Do you speak English?*\n- **Does** he/she/it + fe'l? — *Does he play football?*\n\nQisqa javoblar: *Yes, I do. / No, I don't. / Yes, she does. / No, she doesn't.*\n\nWh- savollar: *Where do you live? What time does the shop open?*"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "titleUz": "Suhbat",
              "lines": [
                { "speaker": "A", "en": "Do you live in Tashkent?", "uz": "Siz Toshkentda yashaysizmi?" },
                { "speaker": "B", "en": "No, I don't. I live in Bukhara.", "uz": "Yo'q. Men Buxoroda yashayman." },
                { "speaker": "A", "en": "Does your brother study English?", "uz": "Akangiz ingliz tili o'rganadimi?" },
                { "speaker": "B", "en": "Yes, he does. He wants to get C1!", "uz": "Ha. U C1 olmoqchi!" }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "exercises": [
            {
              "type": "MCQ_SINGLE",
              "skill": "GRAMMAR",
              "promptUz": "To'g'ri variantni tanlang:",
              "data": { "text": "My parents ___ watch TV in the morning.", "options": ["doesn't", "don't", "aren't", "isn't"] },
              "answer": { "value": "don't" },
              "explanationUz": "«My parents» = they → don't."
